なかったみたいなんがもっと嫌なんで\n私は必要なら病院行くのためらわない派","ts":"1627543574.372900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jQlx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56d30bf9-e41d-4b76-ac41-b876f24bac07","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"5月〜7月で歯医者通ってたけど","ts":"1627543472.371200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Ync"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e01f0fb0-198b-4335-86be-c3283d167f93","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"今年の花粉症シーズンは安全をとって市販薬だけでのりきりました(あまり効かない\u0026amp;合ってなかった気もするが)\n一時の耐えれるアレルギーと万が一だとどうしても、ですね","ts":"1627542540.370400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NIFW8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a20fe1af-6b05-4413-a6ec-7ae5265ad2a2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"【速報】東京の感染者 過去最多の見込み　2日連続で3000人超え（フジテレビ系（FNN）） - Yahoo!ニュース - \u003chttps://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/d6ee3971b5e217e567a29d63bc8002e9c9ea08c0|https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/d6ee3971b5e217e567a29d63bc8002e9c9ea08c0\u003e","ts":"1627542294.369000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Yahoo!ニュース: 【速報】東京の感染者 過去最多の見込み　2日連続で3000人超え（フジテレビ系（FNN）） - Yahoo!ニュース","id":1,"title":"【速報】東京の感染者 過去最多の見込み　2日連続で3000人超え（フジテレビ系（FNN）） - Yahoo!ニュース","title_link":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/d6ee3971b5e217e567a29d63bc8002e9c9ea08c0","text":"東京都の新たな感染者が28日に続き3,000人を超え、過去最多を更新する見通しであることがわかった。 関係者によると、東京都で29日に新たに確認された新型コロナウイルスの感染者は、2日連続で3,0","image_url":"https://amd-pctr.c.yimg.jp/r/iwiz-amd/20210729-00317187-fnn-000-1-thumb.jpg?w=640\u0026h=360\u0026q=90\u0026exp=10800\u0026pri=l","blocks":null,"service_name":"Yahoo!ニュース","service_icon":"https://s.yimg.jp/c/icon/s/bsc/2.0/news120.png","from_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/d6ee3971b5e217e567a29d63bc8002e9c9ea08c0","original_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/d6ee3971b5e217e567a29d63bc8002e9c9ea08c0"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"816t2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be38b742-1b97-40dc-82ac-e9aa2e0dcd7e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"コロナウイルス関係なく人が多いので","ts":"1627542261.368800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BT/e8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2eb72ebd-a481-429d-b9b6-22e0bbd6dffa","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ああ、私も病院があいてすぐに行くようにしてますね","ts":"1627542254.368500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2M/JI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a4c4165-5c17-4824-81e4-0282088e627f","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"病院が開く1時間前から順番待ちするの、真剣に検討してますねえ","ts":"1627541920.368400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7=7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72bfb955-219c-4d3c-b3f9-49583ae37ae2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"うーん、アレルギーの薬を処方してもらいたいんだけど、どうするかな","ts":"1627541841.367800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nbHMc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55f417e6-be93-44aa-b3ae-dd8f3799bd31","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"近所の耳鼻科、いつも人がいっぱいなので、行くのがリスクなんじゃないかと思いつつある…","ts":"1627541783.366800","edited":{"user":"U72TB62UF","ts":"1627541799.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0iUZb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9baa88f0-3741-434a-be02-4ce3a9db14dd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"いよいよやばい状態になってきた","ts":"1627541647.366500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X5X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c99a2a02-5608-45fd-80ab-fa2326e4bb0d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なんか、私のフォロワーさんでコロナウイルスに感染した人が見つかってきていて","ts":"1627541638.366100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dz/oA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d603e16-91a9-4970-b174-e7aae67381b0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"PCについては、企業として出すところ(貸し出しとか)はあるだろうけど...","ts":"1627539623.364400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C0gw5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1548c4b0-2f56-4a90-83e2-63d8825ae76a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"新社会人に適切な家の作業環境(含む十分な高速ネットワーク)、わりと負担だろうしなあ...","ts":"1627539594.363900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J7J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13da0698-8bf6-405a-a588-d0914f2dddca","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"去年新卒入社で上京する予定がリモートになったので地元にいる人とかも世の中にはいる","ts":"1627539305.363000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=f+G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da90d329-b50d-407b-905d-9dd62234d2dc","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"就活の絶対条件ですね \u0026gt;リモート","ts":"1627538781.362100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GGM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb32a420-e807-4631-8cb2-06b002b0fbfc","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"次の案件探す時にリモートワークじゃないやつだったらそれだけで対象外すね","ts":"1627538705.361500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"banjaku","count":4,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS","U72TB62UF"]},{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w6wBi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0c5affc-5886-486b-8d4f-04ba5bc193f2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"今は去年の10倍くらい危なくてアメリカの水準に近づいてるのでやばいですよ","ts":"1627538527.360700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2bm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"457db1ae-19ac-4df0-8334-d6cd3b3fb0a0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そのあとはずっとリモートワーク。一時期出社とリモート併用してたんだけど感染拡大続いて無理になった","ts":"1627538506.360000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bhv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29594b1d-4071-4cc1-be0f-926bfc668793","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"去年の四月だけリモートワーク環境整えるために出社していた","ts":"1627538477.359000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G8oaj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf92b9b6-f2f1-413f-bc23-bc50a59706e3","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"6月からの現場は半日しか居なかった","ts":"1627538155.357800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VdBU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf9cf3b3-89a1-4d66-8430-5a4a182f204f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(今年の 4 月入社)","ts":"1627538152.357700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"698"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69acd260-75d7-4cec-b617-e09292fb134f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私は初日以外出社してない","ts":"1627538124.356800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":3,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U01BY3SDBRS","U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jMIwA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dd2a32c-2adf-4abc-8c36-8cd618716b96","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"私は入社して最初の2ヶ月しか出社しないまま今に至る","ts":"1627538108.356600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k1Yl="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ec8a650-7c05-41a8-8ba4-cdfeb8dfdba3","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"今はマンボウ未満なら任意出社","ts":"1627538086.356100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"manbou","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SFSO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81804b39-6fc4-4d9a-a8d5-da2878bc82dd","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"去年の2月に入社して、3月頭に感染症対策は個別相談になったけど誰も相談しなくて、3月末に様子見してる場合じゃねえと思って「持病あるんでリモートオナシャス」「OK!」ってしてもらった。","ts":"1627538015.355500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dzr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d40f147-e11a-44c7-a72c-ca0b10db6a2e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"去年の 2 月末の時点で、今まで基本的にやってなかったリモートワークにいきなり全社対応してそのままうまく回していたので当時の弊社はやはり優秀だった…","ts":"1627537735.354000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":5,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U022XK5866Q","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS","U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DNiHn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c43f86e0-1189-413f-8d08-4ba2bbe6b069","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"感染者でてもやり方かえないのは結構つらいですね","ts":"1627537656.352800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+c="}]},{"client_msg_id":"de3b8c81-7c0e-4ef9-913a-8eca222ab404","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"今年の頭に仕事していた先もそんなかんじ（社員は基本出社。私は一度出向したきり）だったなぁ…\nそれでいて感染者複数出してたけれど\n私もおかげで濃厚接触者になってしまい、それからの2ヶ月ほどほぼ完全に引きこもっていた","ts":"1627537539.352300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hgb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1eefaaef-eeea-4a89-a35a-53cd8ebce200","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"4〜6月頃はどっこもマスクないんでそのまま出社してたわ","ts":"1627537355.349700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kWSU/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba4bcad1-70d6-4605-bab9-7a8ad683e335","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"一応リモート可能だったけどテストとかごついwordのドキュメントの編集とかやると死んでしまう","ts":"1627537297.348400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rM4J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63d4c39a-160b-4c79-b2c0-d5ad9757381d","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"去年の前半の現場それだったからなぁ","ts":"1627537224.346800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ynQk4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fcfcabf-295e-44d6-909b-cf6e002273ce","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"「死ぬ時はみんな一緒だよ」","ts":"1627537137.345600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qtQjv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f59da7c-c07a-4cb7-9a32-85ba0310859b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"巻き込み事故だ","ts":"1627537120.345200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Rj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb2b5e82-82d5-4e05-a94e-71ab9a9c9886","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"10代の頃から日がな一日空や海だけ眺めて終わる生活したいなーって思ってるもんで","ts":"1627537103.345000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MURi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23246548-3a8d-4dcf-b849-ae9f27eddff2","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"「リモートで出来ることはリモートでしろ」\nこれ私からすると羨ましいです。\n弊社は\n「リモートでできない仕事かかえてるスタッフもいるから全員出社」","ts":"1627537072.344500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":5,"users":["U776661HA","U01HFNMNB55","U81LLJ340","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8l7/A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"822df666-f72c-4314-aabb-b1f4c847c664","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"ネットがなくて暇だったらずっと空眺めてたかもな","ts":"1627537052.344200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gs9="}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5e9ba78-9f24-4430-969d-8ceba49dc982","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"飲食業界とかもそうだけど、経済面も鑑みると今だけ我慢すればいいって話でもないのよね。今我慢するとそのまま死ぬ人がたくさんいる","ts":"1627537025.343400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0q5k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4fef207-422e-417c-a0da-6f339564ca2b","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"買い出し不要なら近所の公園と家の範囲内から移動しなくても困らんくらいの出不精","ts":"1627537001.342700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dlZ2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb065c78-bed6-44a6-94fa-bdc81a351c9e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"本当に全員が完全に外出を自粛すると数ヶ月で業界ごとなくなるのがエンタメ界隈なので、週末のおでかけは許してほしい…ファンだけでも買い支えないと、コロナ終わったらとか悠長なことを言っていられない (その頃にはなくなっている)","ts":"1627536976.341700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"352"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9008c63c-a8cc-403c-bee7-792bba2ccdca","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"休日とかに定期券の範囲でぷらっと出歩く事も多かったんですけどね。リモートで出来ることはリモートでしろ（by 弊社）とのお達しが上から出てしまったので出歩けない。","ts":"1627536897.340000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OAUy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bcc2902-c656-4a3d-a7a9-d210ef68fba9","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"リモートワーク入ってからは役所に行くような用事でもなきゃ電車も使わない","ts":"1627536868.339400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lEPRz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"266ea158-2e80-4f4f-81dc-66471f5da43e","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"スーパーにも行きますがそのくらいか","ts":"1627536831.338100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tav3t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a1e7ce2-f49e-4f86-a87d-b55cd99dca72","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"リモートワークになってそれが顕著に","ts":"1627536785.336900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V0m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54a33fe6-faf9-4178-841c-7064f9abdcb8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"外出自体は 1,2 週間に 1 回くらいのペースでしている。マスクはしています :mask:","ts":"1627536779.336700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N7qL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5539914f-dd4c-41d7-9f00-f14e5baa0c72","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"元々仕事がなければこの1ヶ月で顔合わせた相手はコンビニの店員か松屋の店員\nみたいの生活がかなり平常運転なので","ts":"1627536763.336000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fmq/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"114f293d-5775-4d94-9d2f-1c84a7246c6c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分はあまり外出の欲がないからいいけど、まあ辛い人もおおそうよね","ts":"1627536716.334900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yr5PS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31e37b3f-5b21-4514-ac42-749cb4884df9","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"それより外出自粛によるストレべが結構ヤバいですね。このご時世なのでスパ銭とか行くの躊躇しますし。","ts":"1627536678.334200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O+q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"595bd408-ed1b-44b9-8e6e-2984ae687d60","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"物心付く前に小児ぜん息だったらしいんで人よりはその手の症状になりやすいのがつらい","ts":"1627536456.332900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7m3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd202eb3-eaed-45b6-a95a-a5a53fe33eeb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"「知り合いのギャル」がいる世界線に生まれたかった。。（そこじゃない","ts":"1627536444.332500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R0KKQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8965068d-559d-4476-936b-591fd3cca77c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"自分は窒息しない程度に首を絞められるような経験なんですがね。溺れているのに意識だけがハッキリ残っててずっと苦しむと言った方がいいかな。","ts":"1627536415.331600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nri"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abd32d80-30c2-4174-8446-03e1a9a50947","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"気管支ぜんそく持ちなので呼吸器系疾患が冗談抜きでエグいのはよく理解できる…。","ts":"1627536238.329800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m73"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02db4643-77bd-4d9d-89f5-1b6f13b3e6a2","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"苦しくなって咳き込むの繰り返しでなぁ・・・","ts":"1627536231.329600","thread_ts":"1627536231.329600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uNG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1488d0ac-9984-48f9-b52b-bdfe901195a2","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"横になってると肺から息が勝手に漏れて\n息を吐ききった状態になってしまうので眠れないやつだった","ts":"1627536209.328600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"czd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"549d1772-b95f-4242-8ef6-d1f2c36a6641","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"去年かかった肺炎","ts":"1627536081.326800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zqa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09752e8d-b5c7-423d-8067-bed9febb101f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"一番エグいのが死んだほうがマシってくらい生活に支障出てるのに生きてるってやつすな","ts":"1627536033.326100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V1TiO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d1a43c6-19b0-4bbf-a60f-ceb71dd07b0a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"宇宙に放り投げれば考えるのを止めてくれます(ちがう","ts":"1627536005.325700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RRMdd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11db8fc1-a229-48b7-9b26-ebebf3c3b678","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"不死系の敵キャラを追い詰める方法の一つか(ちがう","ts":"1627535957.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D8Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57aefaac-3f5e-4c0f-baaa-05f2c71a17a9","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","